Do’s
________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

1. Come prepared to the Lab.
2. Submit your Records to the staff In-charge and sign in the Log Book on entering the Lab.
3. Follow the Lab exercise cycles as instructed by the Department. Violating the same will result in deduction of marks.
4. Use the same login (if any) assigned to you.
5. Put the chairs back to its position before you leave.
6. Backlog exercises to be executed after completing regular exercises.



Don’ts
_________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

1. Move around in the lab during the lab session.
2. Tamper System Files or Try to access the Server.
3. Write Data Sheets or Records in the Lab.
4. Change the system assigned to you without the notice of the Lab Staff.
